WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Your husband is so kind to you

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:05,740
Look how much I care about you

3
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:08,540
You misunderstood. He is not you, so you don’t know.

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:09,780
When he came in with you in his arms

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,060
How scary that looks

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,420
From his nervous look

7
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,050
You can see how much he loves you

8
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,530
Okay, you're back

9
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:17,970
Now I leave it to you to play with your wife without any damage.

10
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:19,490
I bought some breakfast

11
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:23,280
Eat something. I have no appetite.

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,800
You should eat more when you are sick

13
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:27,900
I'm not hungry and don't want to eat

14
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,500
If you don’t eat, your body won’t be able to bear it.

15
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,210
It will be more difficult to recover then

16
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:37,420
Don't you want to grab one in the hospital? You don't want to eat it. You don't want to eat it. You don't want to eat it?

17
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,780
If you don’t want to eat it, why don’t you grab one and take it to the hospital?

18
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:40,740
You don't wait

19
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:44,060
You don't want to go back to the company early. I'll come by myself. I just have a cold.

20
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,140
There's nothing wrong with my hands

21
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,340
How are you eating at this time?

22
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,780
You'd better let me do it myself

23
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,100
I can't eat like this

24
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,300
you are a patient now

25
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:54,180
Patients should stop being so picky. Even if you want me to feed you when you recover, I won’t feed you.

26
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:58,220
It's like someone cares about feeding you

27
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:07,770
He was so fierce just now and now he is

28
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,120
What's wrong with you

29
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,440
Is it because Zhou is too hot?

30
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,640
That's because I have a bad attitude

31
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:15,320
sorry me

32
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,640
I shouldn't be so panicked about you

33
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:18,890
It's my fault. Stop crying.
